"Rule 1: ZERO SCROLLING. Main app shell must be `h-[calc(100vh-4rem)]` with `overflow-hidden`. Only internal panels may scroll."
"Rule 2: MASTER-DETAIL. All CRUD screens must be dual-pane (List on side, Form/Details in center-pane). No isolated floating forms."
"Rule 3: COMPACT FORMS. Inputs must have strict max-widths (e.g., `max-w-md`). Never let inputs stretch to full screen width."
"Rule 4: DARK MODE. Never use `bg-white` or `text-slate-900` in dark mode. Use semantic tokens (`bg-card`, `text-foreground`)."
